pygraphviz 2.0.4 (latest stable upstream release).

2.0.2 adds Python 3.15 support, 2.0.3 fixes the documentation scraper's
path handling, and 2.0.4 builds the SWIG module against the Python stable
ABI (Py_LIMITED_API 3.10) and generates graphviz.py at build time instead
of shipping it. The module is now installed as _graphviz.abi3.so. The
minimum Python (3.10) and Graphviz (2.46) versions and the build
requirements (setuptools>=78, swig>4.1.0) are unchanged. The version
change replaces the graphviz 16.1.0 revision bump.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); upstream status: not submitted.
Test: profiles/common-build-tools/tests/py-pygraphviz-abi3.sh

